    "text": "Details\n2 reviews\nGuernsey, Guernsey\nLinks\nfacebook.com\nFeatured\nAll Tidied Up Guernsey\nJust finished an emergency full deep clean of a flat for a client coming home from hospital. She wasn't allowed home until it had been throughly cleaned.\nThe place was in rough shape, but now it’s spotless, fresh, and safe for recovery.\nDecluttered, disinfected, scrubbed every surface, and brought back some comfort and dignity.\nClean home = peaceful mind.\nHappy me 😁\nPlease consider sharing so hopefully I can reach more people who need help.\n\nPosted with permission of the client.\n\n#DeepClean #BeforeAndAfter\n+3"
  },
