  "reviews": {
    "summary": "2 reviews\nSarah Dorey  recommends All Tidied Up Guernsey .\n\nAfter just a few sessions Sarah has started to transform our messy house back into a home.  She is efficient and non-judgmental and I would highly recommend her to anyone, but especially to those who need help with decluttering but are finding it difficult to make the first move.  I am so thankful that I saw her advert on Facebook.\n1\n1\nAll Tidied Up Guernsey\n\n1y\nThankyou so much\nReply",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "After just a few sessions Sarah has started to transform our messy house back into a home.  She is efficient and non-judgmental and I would highly recommend her to anyone, but especially to those who need help with decluttering but are finding it difficult to make the first move.  I am so thankful that I saw her advert on Facebook.",
