  "posts": [
    {
      "text": "Just finished an emergency full deep clean of a flat for a client coming home from hospital. She wasn't allowed home until it had been throughly cleaned.\nThe place was in rough shape, but now it’s spotless, fresh, and safe for recovery.\nDecluttered, disinfected, scrubbed every surface, and brought back some comfort and dignity.\nClean home = peaceful mind.\nHappy me 😁\nPlease consider sharing so hopefully I can reach more people who need help.\n\nPosted with permission of the client.\n\n#DeepClean #BeforeAndAfter\n\nHave you recently moved into your first home or struggling with 'keeping house' and feeling completely overwhelmed? Boxes everywhere, decisions to make, and no idea where to start or where anything should go—it’s a lot to take on. You’re not alone, and you don’t have to figure it all out by yourself.\nI offer calm, practical advice and hands-on support to help you organise your space in a way that works for you and your lifestyle. From deciding where things should live to creating simple systems that are easy to maintain, I’ll help you turn your house into a home without the stress. Together, we’ll get you organised, confident, and off to a positive, well-prepared start in your new space.\nWhatever your situation I can help. Just\nsend me a message. See less\n\nAmazing advice from this lady. Do drop her a follow if you're interested in learning how to organise.\n\nTap to view the whole meme\n\nAny Virgos here?\n I agree, do you?\n\nTrue or false?\n\nIf you’re finding yourself in this situation, please remember you don’t have to face it alone. Reaching out can feel difficult, but it’s a brave first step toward feeling lighter and more in control again. I’m here to help—no judgement, only understanding. Please get in contact\n See less\n\nJust finished an emergency full deep clean of a flat for a client coming home from hospital. She wasn't allowed home until it had been throughly cleaned.\nThe place was in rough shape, but now it’s spotless, fresh, and safe for recovery.\nDecluttered, disinfected, scrubbed every surface, and brought back some comfort and dignity.\nClean home = peaceful mind.\nHappy me\nPlease consider sharing so hopefully I can reach more people who need help.\nPosted with permission of the client.\n#DeepClean #BeforeAndAfter See less",
